  <h2 id="routes">Where these skills can take you, and how far each route scales</h2>

  <p>
    The routes are ordered by headroom, not by how common they are. Consulting leads because you control price and reach. The salaried ladder is where most people start, so it comes later on the list even though it comes first in time.
  </p>

